This license covers the bortlefinder source code only. Sky-brightness data
fetched at runtime via `bortlefinder.fetch_grid()` (Falchi et al. 2016, "The
New World Atlas of Artificial Night Sky Brightness") is licensed separately
under CC BY-NC 4.0 (attribution, non-commercial) by its original authors --
see README.md and src/bortlefinder/grid.py for details. That data is never
bundled with or distributed by this package.
